# Codex CLI Environment Configuration
#
# Pre-configured inference via Serverless Inference (optional):
#   MODEL_ACCESS_KEY    Model access key (Inference > Manage in the control panel)
#   INFERENCE_MODEL     Model id, e.g. openai-gpt-5.5, openai-gpt-5.2
#
# On first boot, 001_onboot reads /etc/environment first, then /opt/codex-cli.env.
# If MODEL_ACCESS_KEY is set in either place, Codex is configured and the interactive
# setup wizard is skipped.
#
# Or run the interactive setup on first SSH login:
#   /opt/setup-codex-cli.sh

MODEL_ACCESS_KEY=
INFERENCE_MODEL=openai-gpt-5.5
